<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 1ST DAY OF ENGLAND/NZ TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 1ST DAY OF ENGLAND/NZ TEST.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at stumps on the</p>
<p>first day of the third cricket test between England and New</p>
<p>Zealand at Lancaster Park on Friday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 229 for five wickets.</p>
<p> B. Young b Cork			  11   </p>
<p> B. Pocock c Atherton b Croft	 22   </p>
<p> M. Horne c Thorpe b Gough	    42   </p>
<p> S. Fleming st Stewart b Croft	62   </p>
<p> N. Astle c Hussain b Croft	   15   </p>
<p> A. Parore not out			38   </p>
<p> C. Cairns not out			10   </p>
<p> Extras (b-1, lb-13, nb-15)	   29   </p>
<p> Total				     229</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-14, 2-78, 3-106, 4-137, 5-201.</p>
<p>Bowling: Cork 15-3-67-1 (nb-10), Caddick 18-4-33-0 (nb-1),</p>
<p>Gough 16-3-44-1 (nb-3), Croft 24-4-49-3 (nb-1), Tufnell</p>
<p>16-6-22-0, Thorpe 1-1-0-0.</p>
